{
    "info": {
        "name": "Class Management API — MVP-6 (Manual Grading & Reports)",
        "_postman_id": "b1a7e2c0-0006-4000-9000-classmgmt0006",
        "description": "End-to-end MVP-6 flow: teacher builds an exam with an objective + a writing question, assigns it with the Manual grade-publish policy, a student submits (auto-graded objective + pending writing), the teacher grades the writing answer and views the report/CSV export, then publishes grades so the student sees the score + feedback. Cookie-based auth via Postman cookie jar (one session at a time — folders switch actors by logging in). Run folders 1-7 top-to-bottom. Reuse the 'Class Management - Local' environment.",
